14	// text differs from the base's (markers and whitespace off - the marking pass owes
15	// nothing), a skill whose description, load triggers or body text moved, a check
16	// module or declaration whose non-comment content moved, a task's declaration or
17	// worker, the manifest. A carrier with no file at all is the world half's finding, not
18	// this one's.
19	//
20	// A provenance file is meant to grow: a changed file keeps every base line in place and
21	// adds after the last entry. ONE ADVISORY BRANCH inside a blocking rule says so where a
22	// line was lost or altered, and refuses nothing (the owner's call, 2026-09-20): a wrong
23	// entry is answered by a later entry, and the one rewrite that is right, the backfill
24	// replacing what the conversion wrote with the element's derived history, is the diff's
25	// to show.
26	//
